      ErrorCode.VALIDATION_FAILED,
      `L\xF4 ${batch.id} ch\u01B0a c\xF3 b\xE1o gi\xE1. G\u1ECDi POST /v1/settlement/batches/${batch.id}/quote tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi g\u1EEDi.`
